The user is asking for an evaluation of the most recent version of the Vauxhall Mokka with the "Elite Premium" trim. This refers to the current generation Mokka (launched 2020/2021). I will evaluate based on the specifications and reviews for this model and trim, focusing on the 1.2 Turbo petrol engine as it's a common option for this trim.

